WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.307 --> 00:00:06.432
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <b>Part 4</b>

2
00:00:11.252 --> 00:00:15.552
About a year later, the judge met Inspector McCleary.

3
00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:19.616
‘Lovely weather we’re having,’ said the judge.

4
00:00:19.826 --> 00:00:22.841
‘By the way, how’s Mrs McCleary?’

5
00:00:23.445 --> 00:00:25.553
Inspector McCleary looked sad.

6
00:00:25.965 --> 00:00:33.959
‘Well, sir,’ he said, ‘Mrs McCleary…the thing is…we got divorced.’

7
00:00:34.144 --> 00:00:37.469
‘No! Really?’ said the judge.

8
00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:40.425
‘I thought she was a wonderful young woman.’

9
00:00:41.029 --> 00:00:44.926
‘That was just the problem,’ said McCleary sadly.

10
00:00:45.312 --> 00:00:47.462
‘A young man fell in love with her.

11
00:00:47.663 --> 00:00:50.552
He was a millionaire businessman from Melbourne.

12
00:00:50.837 --> 00:00:53.390
They left for Australia last week.’